## Key Constraints

- Settings file extension: `.settings`
- Settings directory: `/settings`
- Paper sizes source: `/assets/paperSizes/paper_sizes`
- Preferences file: `preferences.json`

## Piece Arrangement Options

`layoutMode` (radio group) — all modes preprocess the piece so the grainline points up.

| Mode | Description | Trial set |
|------|-------------|-----------|
| `alongGrainline` | Default. Grain-up baseline; allows head-up or head-down. | `{0°, 180°}` |
| `withNap` | Strict no-flip — every piece points the same direction (napped or directional fabric). | `{rotationStep°}` (singleton) |
| `rotate` | Free rotation in fixed steps; uses `rotationStep`. | `{0°, k·rotationStep mod 360°}` |

`rotationStep` semantics depend on `layoutMode`:

| Mode | Sub-radio label | Allowed `rotationStep` | Default |
|------|----------------|------------------------|---------|
| `alongGrainline` | _(no sub-radio)_ | unused | — |
| `withNap` | **Nap Direction** — Pieces point Up / Pieces point Down | `{ 0, 180 }` | `0` (head-up) |
| `rotate` | **Rotation Step** — 10° / 22.5° / 45° / 90° | `{ 10, 22.5, 45, 90 }` | `22.5` |

## Viewer Preferences

- DXF/PDF viewers: Use OS default if path empty
- 3D viewer: Default URL is `https://3mfviewer.com/`